==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~14 seconds<sup>60f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2.67~13.33 seconds<sup>80f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchi]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Swordsman (form 1) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 1)]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

